---
title: Creole Green Beans
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Veggies
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@bacon{4%slices}
@dry onion soup mix{3%Tbsp}
@brown sugar{1%Tbsp}
@salt{1/4%tsp}
@tomato sauce{1%8-oz can}
@cut green beans{1%can}

Cook bacon until crisp, drain, and save @bacon drippings{1%Tbsp}, mix crumbled bacon, bacon drippings, drained green beans and rest of ingredients. Put in casserole, cover and bake at 350 degrees.
